      textKey: narrative.last_corridor.comms-01
      englishFallback: The main lane is obstructed. The original engineer can restore
        its marked link with a six-second hold; the protected alternate remains connected.
        Keep medicine on the safer lane and choose the confirmed route for Fuel and
        the keys. This guidance does not move the convoy for you.
